Third-party components
----------------------

The firmware source in this repository uses no external Arduino libraries, but
a compiled firmware binary links the following components provided by the
Arduino core for ESP32 and its bundled SDK:

- arduino-esp32 (the esp32:esp32 Arduino core): LGPL-2.1-or-later
- ESP-IDF, esp32-camera, NimBLE (Apache NimBLE port), mbedTLS: Apache-2.0

The Python tools in tools/ use:

- pyserial: BSD-3-Clause

If you distribute compiled firmware binaries, you must honour the terms of the
LGPL-2.1 for the arduino-esp32 core (for example, provide the corresponding
source or the means to relink against a modified core) in addition to the
Apache-2.0 notices of the SDK components. Distributing the source alone under
the MIT License carries no such obligation.
